{
 "schema": "cadre-hmi-walk-effects/1",
 "about": "What the simulation of tools/plants/wtp.py does after a command, for the generated walk (tools/compare/walk.py). A pump or a motor in manual runs while its command is true and it has no fault; its speed is its speed setpoint while it runs and 0 otherwise; FIT-101 reads 1.25 times P-101's speed, within 0.6, and 0 while P-101 is stopped; a filter follows its inlet valve, and its differential pressure reads 0 while the valve is closed.",
